# make dos-play on the period machine (PLAY_MACHINE) with the clock set: skip the intro,
# freeze the copy-protection glyphs and answer them, then leave the keyboard to the
# player. At 8,000 cycles/ms the question is manual page 16's right code, ALTAR.
mode 13
delay 5000
key enter
delay 20000
key enter
delay 3000
key a l t a r enter
